{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mini Auto Pachinko Machine on Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a quiet pachinko simulator that runs in a corner of your desktop.</strong><br>Whether you're working, gaming, or just browsing \u2014 the pachinko never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch marbles and aim for consecutive hits in the score box.<br>Watch as the colors intensify, effects stack up, and a satisfying reward loop unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both auto-firing and manual control are available, letting you enjoy the idle income while still feeling the thrill of shooting marbles yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned coins on various upgrades \u2014 unlock new marbles, enhance your launcher, get higher-paying part-time jobs, and unlock new machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your very own pachinko life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995980/extras/d29773cf90aa4fde5eb3ec32df08c0d5.poster.avif?t=1758719533\" width=312 height=1032 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995980/extras/d29773cf90aa4fde5eb3ec32df08c0d5.webm?t=1758719533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995980/extras/d29773cf90aa4fde5eb3ec32df08c0d5.mp4?t=1758719533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995980/extras/4a1825365749df56e448392f4e0d0b34.poster.avif?t=1758719533\" width=312 height=1032 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995980/extras/4a1825365749df56e448392f4e0d0b34.webm?t=1758719533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995980/extras/4a1825365749df56e448392f4e0d0b34.mp4?t=1758719533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pachinko machine that runs while you work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different machine themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 types of marbles to please your eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background music to delight your ears</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marbles won from the pachinko machine can be exchanged for in-game credits, which can be used to purchase themes, marbles, and upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the theme, marbles, and music to create your desired atmosphere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel unlucky, upgrade your launcher\u2019s performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of marbles? You can convert credits back into marbles! By default, this happens automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're not good at pachinko, you can still earn well through effort. Upgrade your job to increase your credit income!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>This game contains flashing lights and rapid visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viewer discretion is advised.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get a new job!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1995980/cc96561e2ae54695af82f5ede346f90234f821e8.jpg"},{"name":"Get a new ball!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images